;200,17 - Max Def.Special
;200,18 - Blaze Stand Special Sound
;200,19 - Skate Stand Special(?)
;200,20 - Jack Knife Spin
;200,21 - Menu Cursor Move
;200,22 - Menu Cusor Select
;200,23 - ???
;200,24 - ???
;200,25 - Jet Sound
;200,26 - Fire Sound
;200,27 - Enemy Fall
;200,28 - Particle Laser Shot
;200,29 - ??? (Used as Hakuyo FirePalm Sound)
;200,30 - Particle Land from jump
;200,31 - Particle Spike Ball hit
;200,32 - ???
;200,33 - Particle Sound?
